          "text": "Post- traumatic stress disorder (PTSD)",
          "is_correct": true
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "ANSWER: C PTSD has a dissociative subtype, which includes depersonalization and/or derealization.",
      "explanation_images": [],
      "explanation_image_url": null
    },
    {
      "question_number": 4,
      "question_id": "0796d4f7-8c33-4638-ab1b-3ee6b23b66ea",
      "question_type": "MULTIPLE_CHOICE",
      "difficulty": "MEDIUM",
      "question_text": "Dissociative amnesia is usually differentiated from other amnesias by:",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "image_url": "",
      "options": [
        {
          "letter": "A",
          "option_id": "356f9fa5-9f6a-4a51-b968-7577952dd35e",
          "text": "An older age at onset of symptoms",
          "is_correct": false
        },
        {
          "letter": "B",
          "option_id": "4e6d8daf-fece-4cff-90e4-b46489f7fd2a",
          "text": "Lack of precipitating stressors",
          "is_correct": false
        },
        {
          "letter": "C",
          "option_id": "4f2f8a70-6a27-4c67-bb34-fcfe345e715a",
          "text": "Autobiographical– episodic anterograde amnesia",
          "is_correct": false
        },
        {
          "letter": "D",
          "option_id": "f12590e8-b397-4508-aec3-3c4209340ba0",
          "text": "Autobiographical– episodic retrograde amnesia",
          "is_correct": true
        }
      ],
      "correct_answer": {
        "letter": "D",
        "option_id": "f12590e8-b397-4508-aec3-3c4209340ba0",
        "text": "Autobiographical– episodic retrograde amnesia"
      },
      "correct_answers": [
        {
          "letter": "D",
          "option_id": "f12590e8-b397-4508-aec3-3c4209340ba0",
          "text": "Autobiographical– episodic retrograde amnesia",
          "is_correct": true
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "ANSWER: D Autobiographical-episodic retrograde amnesia is common in dissociative amnesia and not in neuropsychiatric causes of amnesia (without other deficits). Dissociative amnesia is also characterized by early onset and relationship to stressors. It is less common to have anterograde amnesia.",
      "explanation_images": [],
      "explanation_image_url": null
    },
    {
      "question_number": 5,
      "question_id": "ea4d435f-40b9-4389-ad54-be1a4a2cf6fd",
